  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## No-Show Shield 1: reminders, deposit request and at-risk alert\nRuns every hour. Reads your Bookings sheet and sends the deposit request, the 48h and 24h reminders (SMS via Twilio or email), flags unconfirmed bookings within 12h to you, and triggers the waitlist when a row is set to Cancelled.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with tabs Bookings, Waitlist and Report using the CSV headers in the sheet-templates folder; paste its ID into the Config node (sheetId).\n2. Fill in the Config node: business name, owner email, time zone offset (for example -05:00), channel (sms or email) and your own Stripe/PayPal payment link.\n3. Attach credentials on nodes with a warning icon: Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP, and Twilio (HTTP Basic Auth: Account SID / Auth Token) if you use SMS.\n4. Execute once with test rows, then activate.\n5. Bookings.date must be YYYY-MM-DD and time 24h HH:MM (format the columns as plain text).",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
   "id": "47cc00b2-948c-59b9-bd43-16c14819e899",
   "name": "Read me",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    240,
